      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i got a little cut on my arm like two days ago and it was fine but now there is this thin red line going up my arm from the cut. i also feel kinda shivery like i have a fever or something. should i just keep putting neosporin on it or do i need to go in to see a doctor?",
